"faqs":[
  {
    "id": "1",
    "question": "How do I book an appointment?",
    "answer": "Simply browse through our professionals, select your preferred service provider, choose an available time slot, and complete the booking with secure payment. You'll receive instant confirmation."
  },
  {
    "id": "2",
    "question": "Can I reschedule or cancel my appointment?",
    "answer": "Yes, you can reschedule or cancel your booking up to 24 hours before the appointment through your dashboard. Late cancellations may incur a small fee depending on the provider’s policy."
  },
  {
    "id": "3",
    "question": "Do I need to create an account to book?",
    "answer": "Yes, creating an account allows you to manage bookings, view your history, save favorite professionals, and get personalized recommendations."
  },
  {
    "id": "4",
    "question": "How do I pay for my appointment?",
    "answer": "All payments are handled securely through our integrated payment gateway. You can pay using credit/debit cards, PayPal, or mobile money depending on your region."
  },
  {
    "id": "5",
    "question": "Are the professionals verified?",
    "answer": "Yes, every professional on our platform goes through a verification process to ensure qualifications, professionalism, and customer safety."
  },
  {
    "id": "6",
    "question": "What happens if my professional cancels?",
    "answer": "In the rare event of a cancellation, you’ll be notified immediately and offered the option to reschedule with another professional or receive a full refund."
  },
  {
    "id": "7",
    "question": "Can I leave a review after my appointment?",
    "answer": "Absolutely! After your session, you’ll be prompted to rate and review your experience to help others make informed choices."
  },
  {
    "id": "8",
    "question": "Is my data secure?",
    "answer": "We take your privacy seriously. All personal and payment data is encrypted and stored following industry-grade security standards."
